h fried chicken ($3 up charge) and my hubby ordered a fish plate, mac&cheese, with a bell pepper. I can't lie his bell pepper was a little to hard for our liking (because we eat the actual bell pepper, not just the stuffing). Even with that, the food was extremely delicious and we were looking for the bed and it was lunch time. We ordered online with easy contactless, curbside, pickup. We'll be back and thanks for an amazing lunch that will carry over to dinner."},{"business_id":"OSyRjc5SLixdhnvpsqg5MA","review_id":"4pmU1eWGjDubbWOWmGSeyw","date":"2020-10-14T18:36:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9158263206481934,"text_excerpt":"Thank you so much for my lunch! It was delicious and full of flavor. I was tried of eating fast food when working these 12hr shifts. And when I yelped \"home cooking\" this was the first thing that popped up. Glad it did! Will definitely be returning for my home cooked meals."},{"business_id":"OSyRjc5SLixdhnvpsqg5MA","review_id":"r4C5Zs2ql3ZK_KiQ90X90A","date":"2021-08-01T16:18:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9121378064155579,"text_excerpt":"Hi! If you're looking for some cooking that tastes like your grandmothers this is the spot! I definitely will be back SOON! The food definitely will put you to sleep lol Greens w/rice Corn bread Spaghetti & cheese Sweet potatoes Sweet peas Fried Shrimp Fried okra Bread pudding Check them out Rating #food #nola #foodie #rivvaeats #delicious #nolafoodie #foodporn #yummy #dinner #lunch #fresh #frog #legs #quail #cocktails #instagood #love #photooftheday #happy #soulfood #foodgasm #photography #wherenolaeats #whereblacknolaeats #summer #nolafood #neworleans #neworleansfoodie #yum #delish"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OSyRjc5SLixdhnvpsqg5MA","photo_id":"n2OJcpDVhnlo1j3rIBrAAA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/n2OJcpDVhnlo1j3rIBrAAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8978055715560913},{"business_id":"OSyRjc5SLixdhnvpsqg5MA","photo_id":"CcY01P5JA1jDPx26-JXYeA","label":"food","image_url":"/p